  message: "Deprioritized to P4: this is a tree-sitter-objc upstream grammar limitation. Complex ObjC files (blocks, GCD, NS_ASSUME_NONNULL, multi-@implementation) exceed the grammar's capabilities. ~90% of files parse correctly. Workaround: could contribute grammar fixes to tree-sitter-objc upstream, but that's outside hypergumbo scope."  # a102
